  <participating-org role="4" type="23">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">SMEX is a not for profit, non-governmental organization, dedicated to advancing digital rights in Lebanon and the Arab region, through research, campaigns, and advocacy initiatives which encourage users to engage critically with digital technologies, media, and networks. SMEX was established in 2008 to champion the notion that the internet is a public space made for all, SMEX is committed to keeping the internet accessible, free and open. Over the last ten years SMEX has convinced policymakers to improvetheir policies, circulated valuable information through blog posts and training sessions, hosted regional conferences, conducted in-depth investigations and staunchly advocated for free, fair and safe access to digital resources.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Social Media Exchange</narrative>
  </participating-org>
